    "narrative": "For Ghost Ride the WHIP today, the offensive engine centers on **Corbin Carroll** and **James Wood**, who represent our highest-upside anchors with efficiency scores of 87.04 and 78.42, respectively. **Corbin Carroll** benefits from a prime slot in the three-hole against Ure\u00f1a, with his projected xWOBA of .370 and a +16% boost from the pitcher\u2019s skill level positioning him as an elite start. Similarly, **James Wood** is set to feast against a soft 6.03 xERA from Spence; hitting leadoff combined with an elite .403 xWOBA profile makes him our primary catalyst for Run production. While **Tyler Soderstrom** sits at a strong 69.85, the true platoon value today is found in the middle of the order, where **Seiya Suzuki** and **Gabriel Moreno** leverage favorable park factors and the matchup against Lorenzen and Ure\u00f1a, respectively, to maintain high-floor status.\n\nThe most difficult decision on today's card was limiting the exposure of our bottom-tier hitters. **Henry Bolte** and **Zach McKinstry** currently provide the least insulation against their respective matchups. While **Henry Bolte** earned a 47.80, his score was dragged down by an unfavorable R/R platoon dynamic and an eighth-spot assignment, barely keeping him ahead of the bench threshold. We are currently navigating a depleted roster, with **Josh Naylor** and **Jose Caballero** unavailable due to team off-days, and injury designations for **Vinnie Pasquantino** and **Mickey Moniak** preventing any potential rotation into the lineup. The bench remains thin; consequently, our primary objective is to maximize the efficiency of **Dalton Rushing** and **Alex Freeland**, both of whom are facing Nick Martinez. Despite the 4.69 xERA, their low-order positioning limits their scoring ceiling, though they remain necessary to preserve our game caps while we wait for high-impact contributors like **Austin Riley**, **Giancarlo Stanton**, **Trevor Story**, **Brice Turang**, **Max Muncy**, **Cole Young**, **Carson Williams**, and **Travis Bazzana** to cycle back into active matchups.",
